# Licences

This repository is **dual-licensed**. Which licence applies depends on whether
a file is software or curriculum content.

| Part | Paths | Licence |
|------|-------|---------|
| **Software** | `course-engine/crates/`, `course-engine/scripts/`, `course-engine/web/`, `course-engine/fuzz/`, build and config files | **MIT** (below) |
| **Curriculum content** | `modules/`, `practice/`, `reference/`, `00-curriculum-map.md`, `STUDY-PLAN-14-DAY.md`, `HOW-TO-USE.md`, `course-engine/bank/`, `course-engine/knowledge/` | **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0** (below) |

When a file could plausibly fall under either, the **content** licence governs
if it is prose written to teach, and the **software** licence governs if it is
executable or machine-consumed.

