## Third-party marks and sources

Third-party trademarks (EPI®, EXIN®, CDCP®, ASHRAE, TIA, etc.) remain the
property of their respective owners. This project is an independent study tool
and is **not affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by EPI or EXIN**.
Marks are used only for domain identification.

Completing this program does not grant any certification.

`course-engine/knowledge/corpus/` contains references to publicly available
material. Only sources that permit redistribution are stored in this
repository:

- `free-pdfs/nist_sp800_123_server_security.pdf` — NIST SP 800-123, a
  US Government work in the public domain.
- ASHRAE TC 9.9 white papers and technical bulletins are **not** redistributed
  here. Their `*.meta.toml` sidecars record the source URL and a SHA-256 so
  grounding still verifies; fetch them yourself from ashrae.org, or run
  `python3 course-engine/scripts/fetch_public_corpus.py`.
- `public/*.txt` are short public-summary captures retained for citation
  grounding, each recording its source URL and fetch date. They remain the
  property of their respective publishers.
